<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Chennai to Jaipur | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike transport from Chennai to Jaipur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid registration certificate, a copy of your driving licence, a government‑issued ID proof, and a signed packing checklist. If the bike is financed, a No‑Objection Certificate from the lender is also required. Packagers verify these documents during the pre‑move inspection to ensure smooth customs and insurance processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my bike protected against scratches and dents during the long highway haul?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp trailers feature cushioned loading platforms and anti‑vibration mounts. The bike is first wrapped in an 80‑GSM bubble layer, then cushioned with high‑density foam edges, followed by corrugated fiberboard sheets and a stretch‑film seal. This 7‑layer system, combined with secured ratchet lashings, eliminates movement and protects against road‑induced shocks.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Chennai to Jaipur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every carrier is equipped with a GPS unit linked to our live‑tracking portal. You receive a unique tracking ID that lets you view the bike’s exact location, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations. This transparency is a core promise of packers and movers chennai to jaipur services.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical delivery time for bike shifting between Chennai and Jaipur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the transit takes 5‑7 business days covering approximately 2,100 km via NH 16. Our route planning accounts for major checkpoints, fuel stops, and mandatory driver rest periods. Weather or unexpected road closures may add a day, but we keep you informed throughout.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the insurance coverage truly 100% of my bike’s declared value?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We provide IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that covers the full declared value of your two‑wheeler. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, the claim settlement is processed directly with the insurer, ensuring you receive the exact amount you declared without any deduction.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer any additional services like disassembly or re‑assembly of the bike?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We can handle basic disassembly such as removing the side stand, windscreen, and accessories upon request. Our technicians use specialized tools to ensure each component is packed safely. Re‑assembly at the destination is also available, allowing you to ride immediately after delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the pricing for bike transport differ from household shifting on the same route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Bike transport pricing is calculated on a per‑bike basis, factoring in distance, fuel surcharge, 7‑layer packaging, and insurance. Household shifting includes additional variables like volume, number of cartons, and furniture handling. Our transparent quote separates these costs, so you only pay for the specific two‑wheeler service you need.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
